  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Talk in Shang Clan City also pairs him with Bai Ning Bing as the Black and White Demons. Narration notes he is still rank three peak stage, far from the separate rank five demonic Gu Master called Beast King who occupies Bai Shou mountain with a hundred beast army. The same stretch treats the “Little” form as people thinking highly of Fang Yuan’s future.",
      "chapters": [
        321
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "fac_black_and_white_twin_demons",
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "sys_beast_king",
        "loc_bai_shou_mountain",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On San Cha Mountain, watchers name black and white twin demons Fang Zheng and Bai Ning Bing, recall Fang Zheng’s battle stage fame, and say people call him little beast king. Later talk in the same stretch says little beast king has a heavy murderous nature and does not spare spectators.",
      "chapters": [
        337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenges-at-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_fang_zheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hu Mei Er calls him little beast king when she presses him over leaving a maiden in distress, then again when she vows that only villains and women are hard to please and that she is both.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenges-at-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hu_mei_er"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tyrant Heng Mei shouts the title when Fang Yuan will not give him face. After trading moves, Heng Mei rethinks the so-called little beast king as far stronger than expected, and secret watchers dwell on the nickname.",
      "chapters": [
        340
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenges-at-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tyrant_heng_mei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mountain talk says little beast king killed Tyrant Heng Mei and smashed Fei Li into minced meat, and that those victims were rank four middle stage while little beast king used initial stage cultivation. Xue San Si answers a challenge by flattering little beast king and naming the black and white demons’ renown.",
      "chapters": [
        342
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenges-at-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fei_li",
        "char_xue_san_si"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Xue San Si falls, talk again counts another rank four Gu Master killed by little beast king.",
      "chapters": [
        343
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenges-at-san-cha-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hu Mei Er asks Li Xian to deal with little beast king. Li Xian reads Fang Zheng as meticulous rather than merely boorish, says the consecutive challenges before the three kings inheritance were premeditated, and predicts that others will avoid a bloodbath with this lunatic so as not to miss the opening. He also notes that killing Xue San Si offended Century Boy.",
      "chapters": [
        344
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "li-xian-reading",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_li_xian",
        "char_century_boy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yi Huo comes to the cave, calls him little beast king, and says his purpose is to invite him to join Shang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        355
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recruitment-and-clan-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yi_huo",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the clash with Tie Ruo Nan’s group, talk says rank four middle stage little beast king has surpassed young master Ruo Nan. Tie Xian Hua shouts that little beast king is too arrogant.",
      "chapters": [
        360
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recruitment-and-clan-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_ruo_nan",
        "char_tie_xian_hua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Talk says little beast king fought against seven and won. The head of Tie clan’s four old-timers calls little beast king Tie clan’s sworn enemy after he killed Tie clansmen, killed Elder Ba Xiu, and chased Tie clan’s young master.",
      "chapters": [
        364
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recruitment-and-clan-conflicts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A few days after he kills Yu Cang, drinkers call him Little Beast King, credit three kings inheritance secrets for his gains, and say he claims to become number one in strength path. Century Boy holds a grudge over Xue San Si and still warns others off open conflict with him. When Fang Yuan arrives outside, they recognize Little Beast King’s voice, and Century Boy answers him by that title. Bao Tong also addresses him as Lord Little Beast King.",
      "chapters": [
        367
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "century-boy-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_cang",
        "char_bao_tong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tells the room that whoever dares to leave is not giving Little Beast King face.",
      "chapters": [
        368
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "century-boy-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toasts and pleas pile up under Lord Little Beast King, and talk calls Little Beast King ruthless to others and even more ruthless to himself.",
      "chapters": [
        369
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "century-boy-banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration says little beast king’s name is talked by countless people and soon spreads crazily across the whole Southern Border while Fang Yuan has disappeared and Gu Immortals order their forces to look for him.",
      "chapters": [
        468
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-name-spread",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mortals who hear the name Fang Yuan ask whether that is the Little Beast King who refined an Immortal Gu on San Cha Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-name-spread",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
